1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,791
I stared at the fourth chair. Nobody
mentioned another person at our

2
00:00:04,791 --> 00:00:05,190
meeting.

3
00:00:05,190 --> 00:00:10,782
Jason and I had come to settle a debt.
Our creditor placed four chairs

4
00:00:10,782 --> 00:00:12,380
beneath the motel awning.

5
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:17,173
Three coffees cooled on the table. He
kept checking the road. Jason

6
00:00:17,173 --> 00:00:19,170
counted the money again, quietly.

7
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:25,155
I asked who else was coming. The man
said his son. He wanted a witness

8
00:00:25,155 --> 00:00:27,150
when we paid him back.

9
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:31,943
I thought witness meant leverage. Then
he said his son believed every

10
00:00:31,943 --> 00:00:34,340
promise broke. Tonight, he'd show
otherwise.

11
00:00:34,340 --> 00:00:39,532
We waited. A young adult arrived soaked
and angry. Jason slid full payment

12
00:00:39,532 --> 00:00:40,730
across the table.

13
00:00:40,730 --> 00:00:46,314
He counted once, thanked us, and handed
back our signed debt note. His son

14
00:00:46,314 --> 00:00:47,910
watched him do it.

15
00:00:47,910 --> 00:00:53,019
I took the fourth chair while they
talked. We had arrived expecting

16
00:00:53,019 --> 00:00:56,000
somebody else to disappoint us that
night.
